## Language
The user writes in Korean. Write everything the user reads in Korean: every spec section (summary, goal, criteria, non-goals, todos and their doneWhen lines, file reasons), ask_user questions and options, task notes, and the plan and result summaries. Keep code, identifiers, file paths, commit messages and pull request text in English.

## Task spec
Spec v3. The user can edit it at any time; read it again with task_spec_read before you change it.

### Background
Add hello.sh that prints hello, with a test.

### Summary
There is no hello script. Running hello.sh prints hello.

